     1329          B-add:HIDDEN IN FRAME Dialog-Frame           = TRUE.
     1330   ASSIGN
     1331          B-chg:HIDDEN IN FRAME Dialog-Frame           = TRUE.
     1332   ASSIGN
     1333          B-del:HIDDEN IN FRAME Dialog-Frame           = TRUE.
     1334   ASSIGN
     1335          B-dis-time-rules:HIDDEN IN FRAME Dialog-Frame           = TRUE.
