     1344                             , input v-rid-list) no-error.
     1345     if error-status:error then return no-apply.
     1346     APPLY "END-ERROR":U TO SELF.
     1347   END.
     1348   ON CHOOSE OF B-add IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1349   DO:
     1350   define variable loc#log as logical no-undo.
     1351   define variable loc-doc-rec as recid no-undo .
     1352   define variable  v-templ-rl-root     like ub.dis-time-rule.templ-rl-root     no-undo .
